            <div xml:id="d893">

                <pb facs="0814" n="698" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg698"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/15135.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Special Agent Carothers</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-06-05T10:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 5, 1915—10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Communicate immediately to General Villa the following message received through
                    Brazilian Minister, Mexico City:</p>
                <p>[Message for Villa forwarded in Mr. Cardoso de Oliveira’s telegram of June 4, 10
                    a.m.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
